  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AWH Poultry &amp; Vegetable Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The requested funds will assist AWH to: a) establish procedures and policies in finance, procurement, human resources management; b) train staff and board members in good governance practices; c)Purchase an accounting software; d) train staff in project and financial management; e) business training; f) business plan; g) purchase stock feeds, veterinary drugs, feed troughs and water troughs;</narrative>
  </description>
